## Benefits with source generated approach

### Usability gains
- Developer code would be significantly reduced and becomes more maintainable.
- Allows future support for strongly typed serialization / structured logging (useful to [OpenTelemetry](https://github.com/microsoft/opentelemetry-dotnet-exporters/blob/main/docs/instrumentation-guidance.md#structured-logging))

### Performance improvements
- We get reduced memory allocation, by preventing boxing. On top of that, string formatting in LoggerMessage approach can get replaced by string interpolation which is the preferred way to format text especially by C# 10.

