## Follow up Questions on APIs proposed:

- **Do we have to add the LogValues APIs?** Short answer: No. Worst-case source generator would generate more types rather than having a shared one provided by the framework. The perf cost would be binary size overhead (putting more types in assembly).
- **Do we want LogValues types as reference or value types?** The above LogValues API definitions are presented assuming we want it to be a reference type.
- **Do we have to shipped all the new APIs in our current libraries, or should we place them as a library in a generator package?** 

